@startuml
title Secuencia — Control semáforos viales

actor Operador
participant "Frontend React" as Front
participant "Backend FastAPI" as API
participant "AlertService" as Alert
participant "SemaphoreService" as Sem
participant "Script\nipsemaforo accion" as Script
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Operador -> Front : confirma emergencia
Front -> API : POST /alerts/manual-trigger
API -> Alert : crear evento de emergencia
Alert -> DB : insertar alert_event
Alert -> Sem : ejecutar plan de semáforos
Sem -> Script : ipsemaforo accion <ip> <accion>
Script --> Sem : resultado
Sem -> DB : registrar semaphore_command
Sem --> API : resultado final
API --> Front : OK / detalle
Front --> Operador : estado ejecutado
@enduml
